# Assessment Format

Use this structure for every assessment markdown file (basename from
`.career-pipeline.yml` `naming.assessment`, default `assessment.md`):

```markdown
# Fit Assessment — <Company>

**Role:** <Job Title>
**Company:** <Company>
**Location:** <Remote/Hybrid/Onsite> (<location>)
**Salary:** <range or "Not listed">
**Source:** <URL>
**Assessed:** <date>

---

## Recommendation: <Apply / Pass / Borderline>

<2-3 sentence summary of fit and primary reason>

---

## Strengths

| Requirement | Signal |
|---|---|
| ... | ... |

---

## Gaps / Watch Items

- **<Gap>** — <explanation>

---

## Cover Letter Focus

- <bullet points on what to emphasize>
```

Read workspace-root `.career-pipeline.yml` (`background`, `search`) for personal context when filling strengths and gaps.
